{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Topcraft is a free, cross\u2011platform, top\u2011down sandbox survival game in continuous development where every world is procedurally generated. Start with bare hands, mine resources, craft tools, and build a cozy base or sprawling settlement. Farm, wire contraptions, and reshape the land one tile at a time. Explore forests and caves, battle zombies, spiders, and wildlife, and loot dungeons for rare gear. Survive, discover recipes, and pursue achievements as you carve your path in a tiny, tactical frontier. Join officially hosted multiplayer servers to experience MMORPG features!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3407430?t=1759166693","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407430/5b8a3ebc87430d8fbd3bdb45b3022343ba5c944d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759166693","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407430/0d218fd1f3868d4a24346c91e7f89d9049df99b0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759166693","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407430/0d218fd1f3868d4a24346c91e7f89d9049df99b0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759166693","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Under Development</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407430/extras/b10b310e6dea6bbd3c99a89e93c49ad1.avif?t=1759166693\" width=1224 height=262 /></span>This game is free and already playable, but we continuously work on it further, adding more gameplay features and, most importantly, a multiplayer mode! So buy some Seedlings or Trees to help the developer with that! </p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Topcraft is a free, cross\u2011platform, top\u2011down sandbox survival game 